    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Salaan iyo Mahadnaqid",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawlos oo loogu yeedhay inuu doonistii Ilaah ku ahaado rasuulkii Ciise Masiix, iyo walaalkeen Soostenees, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waxaannu warqaddan u qoraynaa kiniisadda Ilaah ee Korintos ku taal, kuwa quduus lagaga dhigay Ciise Masiix ee loogu yeedhay quduusiin, iyo kuwa meel kasta jooga oo ku barya magaca Rabbigeenna Ciise Masiix oo ah Rabbigooda iyo keennaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimco ha idinla jirto iyo nabad ka timaada Ilaaha Aabbeheen ah iyo Rabbi Ciise Masiix.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mar kasta Ilaahay ayaan idiinku mahad naqaa, nimcadii Ilaah ee Ciise Masiix laydinku siiyey aawadeed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maxaa yeelay, wax walba hodan buu idinkaga dhigay, ha ahaato hadal walba iyo aqoon walbaba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sida laydiinku adkeeyey maraggii Masiixa loo furay; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "si aan hadiyadiinna idiinka dhinmin intaad sugaysaan muujinta Rabbigeenna Ciise Masiix; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kan haddana idinku adkayn doona ilaa dhammaadka, inaad eedla'aataan maalinta Rabbigeenna Ciise Masiix. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaah waa aamin, kan xaggiisa laydiinku yeedhay xidhiidhka Wiilkiisa Ciise Masiix ee Rabbigeenna ah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dadka Kiniisaddu Way Kala Qaybsameen",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walaalayaalow, waxaan magaca Rabbigeenna Ciise Masiix idinkaga baryayaa inaad dhammaantiin isku wax ku wada hadashaan, iyo inaydnaan kala qaybsamin, laakiin inaad ku dhammaataan isku maan iyo isku talo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walaalahayow, dadkii Khalo'ee ayaa iiga kiin warramay in ilaaqi idin dhex taal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tan waxaan ula jeedaa midkiin inuu leeyahay, Waxaan ka mid ahay kuwa Bawlos; mid kalena, Kuwa Abolloos; mid kalena, Kuwa Keeyfas; mid kalena, Kuwa Masiix. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Masiixu miyuu qaybsamaa? Bawlos miyaa iskutallaabta laydiinku qodbay? Ama ma waxaa laydinku baabtiisay magaca Bawlos? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaan Ilaah ugu mahad naqayaa inaanan midkiinna baabtiisin, Kirisbos iyo Gayus maahee ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inaanu ninna odhan, Waxaa laydinku baabtiisay Bawlos magiciisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaan kaloo baabtiisay kuwii guriga Istefanas joogay. Weliba garan maayo inaan qaar kale baabtiisay iyo in kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Masiixu iima uu soo dirin inaan dad baabtiiso, laakiin wuxuu ii soo diray inaan dadka injiilka ku wacdiyo, ee ma aha inaan ku hadlo xigmadda hadalka, waaba intaasoo iskutallaabta Masiixa la caaqibo tiraaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Xoogga Iskutallaabta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, hadalka ku saabsan iskutallaabtu waa u nacasnimo kuwa lumaya, laakiin waa u xoogga Ilaah kuweenna badbaadaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maxaa yeelay, waxaa qoran,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U fiirsada waxa laydiinku yeedhay, walaalayaalow, sidaan loogu yeedhin qaar badan oo xigmad leh xagga jidhka, ama qaar badan oo xoog leh, ama qaar badan oo gob ah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laakiinse Ilaah wuxuu doortay waxyaalaha nacasnimada ah ee dunida inuu ceebeeyo kuwa xigmadda leh, oo Ilaah baa doortay waxyaalaha itaalka daran inuu ceebeeyo waxyaalaha itaalka leh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxyaalaha hoose iyo waxyaalaha la fududaystana Ilaah baa doortay, xataa waxyaalaha aan jirin, inuu waxyaalaha jira wax aan wax tarin ka dhigo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "si aan qofna ugu faanin Ilaah hortiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiin xaggiisa waxaad ku jirtaan Ciise Masiix kan inoo noqday xigmadda xagga Ilaah, iyo xaqnimada, iyo quduusnaanta, iyo madaxfurashada, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in sida qoran, Kii faanaa, Rabbiga ha ku faano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
